From: SMARK <3222301373@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 14:44:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add notebook editing capabilities and metadata handling

- Introduced new `vscode_notebook_edit` tool to handle notebook edits, including tracking cell IDs and operations.
- Enhanced `createPendingToolInputParser` to support notebook edit inputs and statistics.
- Implemented detailed metadata handling for notebook edits, including before and after source tracking.
- Added functionality to render notebook edit diffs and summaries in the TUI without exposing raw source.
- Updated VS Code bridge to manage notebook edit calls and responses, ensuring compact metadata without full artifact text.
- Enhanced tests to cover new notebook edit features, including diff rendering and metadata validation.

